 {
  "verse_id": "s11-v04",
  "song": "s11",
  "verse": 4,
  "final_english": "Since naught of worlds nor world-birth is parted from Thee — Thy unfolding: 'mid marvel-deeds even rises no praise-weaving of Thee.",
