  "final_english": "Kind One! Śarva! Moon-crested! Śiva! Three-eyed rosary-wearing! Glorious! Fierce-skull-signed! Grim-trident-flashing! Pity-sea! Worlds-weaving-natured! Fierce-power-formed! Fair-throated! — swift destroy ill-luck's loads; lay on high Thine own ripening.",
